WEBVTT

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:25.770
The VRMMORPG, <i>Ark Earth Online</i>.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:30.070
Here, there was total freedom.

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:37.990
Everything was left in
the hands of the players.

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:46.580
Even with skills and spells that were
laid out in other existing games,

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:50.960
players had to discover the methods
of mastery from scratch.

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:57.010
The players' originality and ingenuity
expanded the world without limit.

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:01.390
Some sought to master magic.

00:01:01.390 --> 00:01:03.390
Some amassed riches.

00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:07.600
Others honed their techniques.

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:14.110
Many immersed themselves
in <i>Ark Earth Online</i>.

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:22.120
And in time, the players came
to have kingdoms of their own.

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:26.540
No great man can brook a rival.

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:29.830
The players who became kings

00:01:29.830 --> 00:01:34.760
fell to battling one another with
the fate of their kingdoms at stake.

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:38.590
Thus began the Age of Strife.

00:01:40.850 --> 00:01:44.520
Those who played the biggest role
were the warriors,

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:48.520
who were easy to level up and could
be counted on as fighting strength.

00:01:50.270 --> 00:01:55.990
The Age of Strife was
a bleak period for mages.

00:01:58.110 --> 00:02:02.620
However, here was a kingdom
that would be their salvation.

00:02:03.830 --> 00:02:08.040
The Kingdom of Alcait,
ruled by the paladin, Solomon.

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:12.090
The mages, who had nowhere to go,
flocked to this king's side

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:14.500
and together, they worked
to build up this kingdom.

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:17.760
Even among those mages,

00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:20.930
there were those who
were exceptionally talented.

00:02:21.970 --> 00:02:27.310
The Elders who sought to master
the nine different types of magic.

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:31.860
In other words, the Nine Wise Men.

00:02:52.170 --> 00:02:57.380
Among them, the one
King Solomon trusted the most

00:02:57.380 --> 00:03:00.010
was none other than the summoner, Danblf.

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:04.180
Also known as Danblf, the One-Man Army.

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:57.880
You summoned me, Your Majesty?

00:04:57.880 --> 00:05:02.170
Danblf, I wish to have the aid
of your powers once more.

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:05.470
What foe do we face on this occasion?

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:08.640
A giant born of a storm?

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:13.060
Or perhaps an evil god
embraced by heretics?

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:16.560
Ten thousand monsters.

00:05:21.230 --> 00:05:23.610
The monsters have banded together

00:05:23.610 --> 00:05:27.200
and seek to threaten
my land and my people.

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:30.780
As I recall, Soul Howl
is fighting to defend us,

00:05:30.780 --> 00:05:33.950
Luminaria has gone to
reinforce an allied kingdom,

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:37.500
and Valentin is carrying out
a search of a labyrinth.

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:40.630
You are the only Elder who can go.

00:05:40.630 --> 00:05:45.670
Well, well, the timing of it
is far too convenient.

00:05:45.670 --> 00:05:47.380
Indeed.

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:51.720
No doubt some kingdom is behind this.

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:55.310
Danblf, I command you
in the name of Solomon,

00:05:55.310 --> 00:05:57.730
strike down Alcait's foes,
who wish her ill.

00:05:57.730 --> 00:06:01.690
Let the world know the meaning of
your moniker, the One-Man Army!

00:06:01.690 --> 00:06:04.650
As you wish, my king.

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:11.950
That was great, wasn't it?

00:06:11.950 --> 00:06:16.830
Yes, that was quite
the exciting bit of role-play.

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:19.330
I took a screenshot. Care to see it?

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:21.080
Yeah, let's see it!

00:06:23.710 --> 00:06:25.710
Ooh, nice.

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:29.010
This kind of thing is a staple
in the fantasy genre.

00:06:29.010 --> 00:06:33.810
It is one of the true joys
of <i>Ark Earth Online</i>.

00:06:38.100 --> 00:06:39.980
There are so many more now.

00:06:39.980 --> 00:06:43.860
It goes to show how long
we have known each other.

00:06:45.820 --> 00:06:47.650
Oh, this.

00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:53.280
The monster at Lunatic Lake?
It was a formidable opponent.

00:06:53.280 --> 00:06:57.410
Taking down a beast that went
on a rampage every full moon

00:06:57.410 --> 00:07:00.210
was difficult in the extreme.

00:07:00.210 --> 00:07:04.340
Thus, we paid a visit to Fool
the Wunderkammer,

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:09.880
gathered information on the monster,
and succeeded in subduing it.

00:07:09.880 --> 00:07:14.220
Thus, we founded the Kingdom of Alcait.

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:16.600
And we lived happily ever after.

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:21.060
Quests must be completed using
not only brawn, but brains as well.

00:07:21.060 --> 00:07:24.650
This is another one of the
true joys of <i>Ark Earth Online</i>.

00:07:24.650 --> 00:07:26.940
That's so true.

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:30.860
By the way, isn't that
kind of a pain to do?

00:07:30.860 --> 00:07:33.570
It is a recovery item that has no taste.

00:07:33.570 --> 00:07:36.700
It is nice to at least enjoy
the ambience, no?

00:07:38.410 --> 00:07:42.120
You know, you really love
that character of yours, don't you?

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:44.000
Do not call me a character.

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:48.510
While we are inside <i>Ark Earth Online</i>,
I am Danblf!

00:07:48.510 --> 00:07:51.130
It's in the image of
the ideal wizard, was it?

00:07:51.130 --> 00:07:52.510
Indeed.

00:07:52.510 --> 00:07:54.430
In order to create Danblf,

00:07:54.430 --> 00:07:58.720
I watched the hell out of those
movies and those other movies.

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:01.600
This is truly my ideal self!

00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:05.360
I remember you making me come
to see about a third of those with you.

00:08:05.360 --> 00:08:07.020
On my own dime, for some reason.

00:08:07.020 --> 00:08:09.780
I treated you to popcorn
and juice, did I not?

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:12.030
Do not be such a cheapskate.

00:08:12.030 --> 00:08:13.950
I don't think Danblf of the Nine Wise Men

00:08:13.950 --> 00:08:17.240
would use the word "cheapskate."

00:08:18.700 --> 00:08:22.620
At any rate, I am Danblf.

00:08:22.620 --> 00:08:26.500
So, the horde of monsters
is coming from this direction.

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:29.710
Could you control ten thousand monsters?

00:08:29.710 --> 00:08:31.880
I could not do it.

00:08:31.880 --> 00:08:35.930
Someone must have crafted a new spell,

00:08:35.930 --> 00:08:40.720
or possibly, an entirely
new monster has been born.

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:43.390
As long as we wish it,
with originality and ingenuity,

00:08:43.390 --> 00:08:45.600
it is always possible
to create new things.

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:48.440
This place is an incredible world,
isn't it?

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:49.770
What are you saying?

00:08:49.770 --> 00:08:54.400
There cannot be many kingdoms
as intent on researching magic as us.

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:58.070
That's something you guys
started on your own.

00:08:58.070 --> 00:09:02.080
So you say, but you are plotting
something as well, are you not?

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:04.710
It's still a concept that
only exists on paper.

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:07.170
I shall look forward to it.

00:09:07.170 --> 00:09:08.040
Now, then...

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:09.420
Are you going?

00:09:09.420 --> 00:09:10.550
Yes.

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:12.960
You and I founded this kingdom together.

00:09:12.960 --> 00:09:16.180
I will not allow it
to be felled so easily.

00:09:21.640 --> 00:09:23.640
Ah, Lythalia.

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:26.690
Hello, Master Danblf.

00:09:26.690 --> 00:09:30.070
It seems Luminaria is on
another one of her rampages.

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:34.990
Yes, she headed off alone to
reinforce an allied kingdom.

00:09:46.870 --> 00:09:49.960
We will need to redraw the maps once more.

00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:55.260
She is Luminaria,
the Natural Disaster, after all.

00:09:56.760 --> 00:09:57.930
Amalatte.

00:09:57.930 --> 00:10:01.850
Master Danblf, you're wearing
another fabulous robe today.

00:10:01.850 --> 00:10:04.060
Thank you, Amalatte.

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:06.270
I trust Soul Howl is in good health?

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:09.560
He has gone to defend
our border to the south.

00:10:31.670 --> 00:10:34.050
Soul Howl, the Great Wall.

00:10:34.050 --> 00:10:37.800
As long as we have him,
Alcait is sure to be secure.

00:10:46.930 --> 00:10:50.600
I have returned, Mariana, Cleos.

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:53.610
Welcome back, Master Danblf.

00:10:53.610 --> 00:10:55.440
Welcome back.

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:58.740
Mm. I must leave immediately.

00:10:58.740 --> 00:11:01.450
I will trust you to hold
down the fort, Cleos.

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:03.620
Yes, please leave it to me.

00:11:03.620 --> 00:11:06.700
Master Danblf, I shall make
preparations right away.

00:11:06.700 --> 00:11:09.290
No, no need.

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:10.540
I will be going to my Floating Island.

00:11:10.540 --> 00:11:12.500
All right, I understand.

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:14.380
Well, I will leave it to you.

00:11:14.380 --> 00:11:15.920
Master Danblf.

00:11:15.920 --> 00:11:17.760
I wish you luck in battle.

00:11:19.010 --> 00:11:21.300
They are both excellent,

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:24.970
but if only they were
a tad more interesting.

00:11:24.970 --> 00:11:28.680
No, that would be expecting
too much of NPCs.

00:11:40.240 --> 00:11:42.070
Now, then...

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:50.040
That should about do it.

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:52.500
Then, I suppose it is time.

00:12:03.590 --> 00:12:07.680
If you are possessed of wit,
heed my voice!

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:11.140
Try to advance another step forward.

00:12:11.140 --> 00:12:15.270
Do so, and where you set foot
will become your grave!

00:12:18.650 --> 00:12:22.820
So, they will not listen.

00:12:22.820 --> 00:12:25.570
Come forth, my army!

00:12:47.430 --> 00:12:50.180
What say we enliven the mood.

00:12:58.770 --> 00:13:00.400
Go!

00:13:37.480 --> 00:13:40.230
We are no match in terms of numbers...

00:13:44.240 --> 00:13:47.360
Well done, Party Member 1.

00:13:47.360 --> 00:13:49.200
"Too much gunpowder"

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:51.830
It is mana, not gunpowder.

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:54.370
The enemy moves better than I expected.

00:13:54.370 --> 00:13:56.370
I will be counting on you
to sow confusion.

00:13:59.170 --> 00:14:01.840
He alone seems really into it.

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:20.020
"When I'm done with this mission"

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:22.020
With an operation of this scale,

00:14:22.020 --> 00:14:24.780
there must be someone leading them, but...

00:14:24.780 --> 00:14:26.150
Hm?

00:14:28.320 --> 00:14:30.280
That one, is it?

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:32.120
You will not escape.

00:14:44.920 --> 00:14:46.840
That should do.

00:15:00.400 --> 00:15:03.690
Do you have any intention
of revealing who ordered this?

00:15:05.780 --> 00:15:07.690
No, it seems.

00:15:18.330 --> 00:15:21.210
Did you underestimate me,
thinking I was a mage?

00:15:21.210 --> 00:15:23.500
That was unfortunate for you.

00:15:28.470 --> 00:15:31.010
We cannot permit them to escape.

00:15:32.680 --> 00:15:35.890
Your turn, Eisenfald!

00:15:44.270 --> 00:15:46.270
Reduce them to ashes!

00:16:05.710 --> 00:16:10.470
I am no better than
Luminaria at this rate.

00:16:10.470 --> 00:16:14.720
Well, that is fine. Quest cleared!

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:17.720
He simultaneously summoned and led

00:16:17.720 --> 00:16:20.480
seven Valkyries and
a thousand Dark Knights.

00:16:20.480 --> 00:16:23.190
Thus, an army.

00:16:23.190 --> 00:16:25.940
Danblf, the One-Man Army.

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:31.820
You did well to slay
the ten thousand monsters.

00:16:31.820 --> 00:16:36.200
Just what I expect of one of my Nine
Wise Men, Danblf, the One-Man Army.

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:44.080
As long as we have you,
our Kingdom of Alcait is secure.

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:47.630
All I do, I do for my lord.

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:52.880
Several days after this,
Danblf suddenly disappeared.

00:16:52.880 --> 00:16:56.970
In time, it would come to be known
as the Vanishing of the Elders,

00:16:56.970 --> 00:17:02.680
the start of the greatest crisis
the Kingdom of Alcait had faced.

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:09.690
And it was also the start of the
upheaval of <i>Ark Earth Online </i>itself.

00:22:14.540 --> 00:22:15.910
I am...

00:22:15.910 --> 00:22:18.000
"Episode 1
'I Am Cute...'"
...cute.

00:22:18.000 --> 00:22:20.040
"Episode 1
'I Am Cute...'"
